    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07e7bd81bce6b8e4e0f18bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是，凭我、这种事――\n这样的比赛――",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcbca86177cecc32d236bbb371d3b588024aff1a3248c6008c5546be783bec5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        105,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/105/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc4f59675ff84f6496ec2195",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你、一定能做到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a59bf4aa5a47fa6ec03f91a7605d896d45f27641427955bdb7e6b5e43d75cce6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        106,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/106/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e9de5e1753470de03a7794",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "做不到？\n不，绝无可能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a9438d76b4ebf704308966c066535543334cb7f0b9d0a3c3ebb5391555b3ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        106,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/106/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d93bb9607c7b9a50109afa7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我提高的嗓门引来数名路人回头。\n――无妨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d1f1bb05f71626969ba20785390abbd8cb62acbe15dcaaa64a43fa6d1d124f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        107,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/107/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a310bf880c3a73888a195a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹一路走来\n成就了太多太多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38204c53fe6536126cedd1228558739068cabaf943e2f0081af9911511c8bc3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        108,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/108/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f75df31439a4ebc24b242b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她治愈了玫瑰帝国的心，\n她把荣进闪耀编进了圆环，\n她让同期的羁绊牢固到能自行回转。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3bf5e64c62f3049c2e9307178443e15b5d7087742b31de2db6d85b99d2fc14f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        109,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/109/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55038cd326d77aafddbccf34",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beb50d57d7703a64ba6e9d70094d69e3edf1f53654ce1b6055f0ddd7c2b63d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff4bebb6bf5ad93bebb34816",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然身处陌生的异国他乡，\n但只要大家结成圆环，一定没问题的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "321fc831bb8a9df66f8dd0f64b77b2684ce729fe5f2c334896494ade1699e326",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:509b7c73b7186e1b676d9d29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在『日本德比』掀起了狂热，\n她获得了足以比肩迷人景致的实力，\n而后她在『有马纪念』上――\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e1c05a76580160b9e1ed8b4d758b71c603015531db48c02bed517ec48c5f06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        110,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/110/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:074ba297ddec5731696e16a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……现在、日本或许正深陷低谷",
      "source_fingerprint": "16be21a199fd175e7535c350649191c144ef96c426361657a3d03ee79b623469",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        111,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/111/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14dc3853e45d498be0964939",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将日本联结在一起，\n更让一名赛马娘重归赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e67eea8fc7f626010898f6dedc3f0d8b6be272344d34208203b03f06b76c77f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        111,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/111/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2967d86f35e86122c222dbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据玫瑰帝国所说，\n如今许多人的内心支离破碎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4ceac253d482adf4c5d7b5207bc2ed20e28f8be90a7a0132e6b946ce3430992",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        112,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/112/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49033a7dba2bcc3a2c7a5086",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她曾为日本编织的圆环\n也无力地松脱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b907ac07216cc424b714d2e0755383604e623915b513fc5dbe4efc14b24a76a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
